close_reason: "Pins: @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17 -> 2026.9.21, pm-changelog ^2026.9.16 -> 2026.9.18, pm-ops ^2026.9.13 -> 2026.9.18 (package.json and package-lock.json verified). Launcher replaces a vendored TypeScript implementation; removed: nothing else. git config lists the pm merge drivers after npm ci; pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers exits 0; release:check exits 0."
